{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 39, :comments ["עוגות — for 'lechem' is only that which is baked in an oven." "כי לא חמץ — for it did not become leavened. And likewise: כבד לב פרעה. It is a pa'al verb form. And likewise אהב אביו והמלך דוד זקן — הזקין." "וגם צדה לדרך לא עשו — and therefore they needed to complain about bread and water."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {1 "The pa'al (פעל) form in Biblical Hebrew can function as intransitive/causative reflexive depending on context; Rashbam cites זקן (adjective 'old') → הזקין (verb 'grew old') to illustrate the binyan pattern for חמץ."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:16.923773954Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}